# "You may sacrifice ... If you do, draw two cards": the sacrifice is the effect resolving, not a cost, so it is asked of
# Khan's controller and may be declined (CR 608.2d, 701.21a). Declining the choice of a legal artifact (the Mox Pearl) is
# nothing done: no card is drawn, and the Pearl stays on the battlefield beside Khan (CR 608.2c).

